1e:Tef8,Creatine + CBD & CBG is an advanced performance formula designed to support strength, endurance, recovery, and mental clarity . This innovative blend combines 100% pure micronised creatine monohydrate with high-quality CBD and CBG isolates derived from hemp , creating a unique supplement suitable for athletes, fitness enthusiasts, and anyone seeking optimal physical and mental performance.

Creatine is one of the most researched and trusted supplements in sports nutrition, widely known for supporting explosive strength, power output, and muscle recovery . When combined with cannabinoids such as CBD (Cannabidiol) and CBG (Cannabigerol) , this formula provides additional support for recovery, balance, and focus , making it ideal for both training and everyday wellness.

The formula is unflavoured , making it easy to mix with water, smoothies, juice, coffee, or protein shakes without affecting taste.

Advanced Performance Formula

This carefully developed blend supports multiple aspects of performance:

Physical Performance
Creatine helps increase ATP production in muscles, which supports strength, endurance, and high-intensity training performance . This makes it particularly beneficial for weight training, HIIT workouts, sports training, and other physically demanding activities.

Muscle Recovery
CBD and CBG are naturally occurring cannabinoids found in hemp. They are widely studied for their ability to support recovery, muscle relaxation, and post-exercise balance .

Mental Focus
The combination of creatine and cannabinoids may also help support mental clarity, focus, and cognitive energy , making this supplement useful not only for athletes but also for individuals with demanding daily routines.

Inflammation Support

Key Benefits

• Supports strength and power output
• Helps improve muscle recovery after exercise
• Supports mental focus and clarity
• Contains CBD and CBG cannabinoids from hemp
• 0.0% THC
• Minimal processing for purity
• Unflavoured formula – easy to mix with any drink
• Suitable for daily performance support

Active Ingredients Per Serving

Serving size: 1 level teaspoon (approx. 3.5 g)

Ingredient
Amount

Micronised Creatine Monohydrate
3.5 g (3500 mg)

CBD Isolate (from hemp)
16.5 mg

CBG Isolate (from hemp)
2 mg

Nutritional Information

Nutritional Information
Amount

Serving Size
1 level teaspoon (approx. 3.5 g)

Servings per pouch
Approx. 42

Total weight
150 g

Total cannabinoids per pouch:

• CBD: 700 mg
• CBG: 85 mg

Ingredients

100% Pure Unflavoured Micronised Creatine Monohydrate , CBD Isolate (from hemp) , CBG Isolate (from hemp) , Cannabigerol.

The formula contains 0.0% THC , ensuring a non-psychoactive supplement suitable for everyday use.

Recommended Use

Mix 1 level teaspoon (approximately 3.5 g) with 250–300 ml of water, fruit juice, coffee, or warm milk/hot chocolate .

Stir or shake until fully dissolved.

Consume once daily , ideally before or after exercise depending on your routine.

Quality & Manufacturing

This product is manufactured with high-quality ingredients and minimal processing to ensure purity and consistency.

The creatine used is micronised , allowing it to dissolve more easily in liquids and improving absorption.

The cannabinoids used are pure isolates derived from hemp , ensuring precise dosing and THC-free formulation .

Allergen Information

Manufactured in a facility that also processes nuts and seeds .

Important Information

Food supplements should not be used as a substitute for a varied and balanced diet and healthy lifestyle.

Keep out of reach of children.

Not suitable for pregnant or breastfeeding women .

Clever Botanics

