Their earthy aroma, like the Imperial Amnesia Haze, is enriched with mellow juniper and elderflower undertones. Although Sativa-dominant, our testers found Royal Amnesia leans slightly more toward a hybrid. It offers a mild, relaxing, and uplifting effect without sedation. The high CBD content is beneficial for anti-inflammatory purposes, pain management, sedation, and promoting better sleep.

